WEBVTT

NOTE
Alexander - Holy Judgment. Holy fortress summon.
Observed duration in reference video: ~57 seconds.
This is one of the longer summons; cues spaced wider for slow buildup.

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Alexander. Holy Judgment.

00:02.500 --> 00:10.000
The ground splits open. A vast white-and-gold cathedral fortress rises from below.

00:10.000 --> 00:18.000
Alexander stands taller than mountains, towers and battlements lining its shoulders.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
Panels along its arms slide open, revealing rows of glowing cannons aimed downward.

00:28.000 --> 00:38.000
The cannons fire pillars of brilliant holy light onto the enemies, cleansing them in white fire.

00:38.000 --> 00:48.000
A final radiant burst engulfs the field; the holy light overwhelms everything.

00:48.000 --> 00:57.000
The fortress sinks slowly back beneath the earth.
